    "abstract": "Parts list for the flight data recorder installation in the aft equipment area, marking the mandatory fit items against the shared mounting provision that other installations may also use.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the installation hardware of the flight data recorder and the associated control panel, together with the mounting tray spacer set.",
      "figure_note": "The recorder unit is identified by its own part number label and the fifty hour unit and the earlier unit occupy the same tray but need different spacer stacks, which is why the spacer at item 30 is quantity dependent on the installed unit. Items 10, 20 and 30 are mandatory fit: they are the subject of an airworthiness directive and no substitution, no alternate and no local manufacture is acceptable against any of them. Items 60, 70 and 80 are the mounting provision and are shared with any other installation that occupies the same tray; a station finding a different part in one of those positions has not necessarily found a discrepancy, but a different part in item 10, 20 or 30 always is. The cockpit voice recorder control panel is shown for location only and is detailed in its own figure."
    },
